sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/<br/>Interface
    participant Sim as GAMA<br/>Simulator
    participant Config as vu2_config<br/>Parameters
    participant Rice as Rice<br/>Model
    participant Animals as Animal<br/>Model
    participant Display as 3D<br/>Display

    User->>Sim: Start Simulation
    activate Sim
    
    Sim->>Config: Load configuration
    activate Config
    Config->>Config: Load animal_data.csv
    Config->>Config: Set field parameters<br/>(13×13 grid, 1521m²)
    Config-->>Sim: Ready
    deactivate Config

    Note over Sim: INITIALIZATION PHASE (Cycle 0)
    
    Sim->>Rice: create_field_ground()
    activate Rice
    Rice->>Display: Draw green field background
    deactivate Rice
    
    Sim->>Rice: create_rice_field()
    activate Rice
    Rice->>Rice: Create 169 vegetative plants<br/>in 13×13 grid
    Rice->>Display: Draw plants (H=1.0m, green)
    deactivate Rice
    
    Sim->>Animals: create_animals_for_stage("vegetative")
    activate Animals
    Animals->>Config: Get animal_data rows<br/>matching "vegetative"
    Config-->>Animals: 20+ animal types
    loop For each animal type
        Animals->>Animals: Calculate population<br/>(density × field_area × 0.15)
        Animals->>Animals: Create agents<br/>(1-150 per type)
        Animals->>Animals: Set position, movement mode
    end
    Animals->>Display: Draw all animal 3D models
    deactivate Animals

    Note over Sim: SIMULATION CYCLES 1-299 (VEGETATIVE STAGE)
    
    loop Cycles 1-299
        Sim->>Sim: Check progress reflex
        Sim->>Rice: (No stage change)
        Sim->>Animals: (Agents move autonomously)
        Animals->>Animals: Update position toward destination
        Animals->>Animals: Render 3D models
        Display->>User: Show live scene
    end

    Note over Sim: STAGE TRANSITION (Cycle 300)
    
    Sim->>Sim: Evaluate stage_index = 300/300 = 1
    Sim->>Rice: new_stage = "reproductive"
    
    Sim->>Rice: clear_rice_field()
    activate Rice
    Rice->>Rice: Kill all vegetative plants (169)
    deactivate Rice
    
    Sim->>Rice: create_rice_field()
    activate Rice
    Rice->>Rice: Create 169 reproductive plants<br/>in same grid positions
    Rice->>Rice: (H=1.45m, medium green, + panicles)
    Rice->>Display: Draw new plants
    deactivate Rice
    
    Sim->>Animals: clear_animals()
    activate Animals
    Animals->>Animals: Kill all 20+ species<br/>(entire population cleared)
    deactivate Animals
    
    Sim->>Animals: create_animals_for_stage("reproductive")
    activate Animals
    Animals->>Config: Get animal_data rows<br/>matching "reproductive"
    Config-->>Animals: Different set for reproductive stage
    loop For each animal type (may differ)
        Animals->>Animals: Calculate population
        Animals->>Animals: Create new agents
        Animals->>Animals: Set position, movement mode<br/>(may be different life stages)
    end
    Animals->>Display: Draw all new animal models
    deactivate Animals

    Note over Sim: SIMULATION CYCLES 301-599 (REPRODUCTIVE STAGE)
    
    loop Cycles 301-599
        Sim->>Sim: Agents move, render
        Display->>User: Show reproductive stage
    end

    Note over Sim: STAGE TRANSITION (Cycle 600)
    
    Sim->>Rice: new_stage = "ripening"
    Sim->>Rice: clear_rice_field()
    Sim->>Rice: create_rice_field()
    activate Rice
    Rice->>Display: Draw ripening plants<br/>(H=1.70m, yellow, golden heads)
    deactivate Rice
    
    Sim->>Animals: clear_animals()
    Sim->>Animals: create_animals_for_stage("ripening")
    activate Animals
    Animals->>Display: Draw ripening stage animals
    deactivate Animals

    Note over Sim: SIMULATION CYCLES 601-899 (RIPENING STAGE)
    
    loop Cycles 601-899
        Sim->>Sim: Agents move, render
        Display->>User: Show ripening stage
    end

    Note over Sim: CYCLE 900+ (LOOP REPEATS)
    
    Sim->>Rice: Cycle back to vegetative
    Sim->>Rice: clear_rice_field()
    Sim->>Rice: create_rice_field()
    Sim->>Animals: clear_animals()
    Sim->>Animals: create_animals_for_stage("vegetative")
    Display->>User: Restart cycle
    
    par Continuous Loop
        loop Until user stops
            Sim->>Sim: progress_rice_stage reflex
            Sim->>Animals: Move animals
            Sim->>Display: Render frame
        end
    end
    
    User->>Sim: Stop Simulation
    deactivate Sim

